## Traceability Isolation and UI Copy Hygiene

Application interfaces and user documentation (docs) are intended for end users (business owners, staff, or customers). All PRD tracking codes, feature codes, screen IDs, wireframe ordinal numbers, and phase numbers are strictly prohibited from appearing in labels, badges, placeholders, toasts, modals, or guide text. Technical codes belong strictly in internal tracking metadata, testing IDs (`data-testid`), or developer notes.

